          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "திறப்புவிழா — tiṟappuviḻā — \"an opening ceremony\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "புதிய நூலகத்தின் திறப்புவிழா இன்று நடந்தது. putiya nūlakattiṉ tiṟappuviḻā iṉṟu naṭantatu. The opening ceremony of the new library took place today."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "திறப்பு, opening + விழா, festival."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "திறப்புவிழா (tiṟappuviḻā) is a Tamil compound built from திறப்பு, \"opening\", from திற, \"to open\" (DEDR 3259), and விழா, \"festival\" (DEDR 5427)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for telling what happened."
            }
          ]
